    "long_instructions": "You are a content creator with a dedicated fanbase. Your viewers need to know exactly when to tune in for specific games. To keep them notified, you use a Social Media Scheduler.\r\n\r\nBased on the updates that you receive over the next four levels, use **PAIR Programming with AI** to  help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🎮 DLC Release!\r\n**Status:** New Event Added\r\n\r\n**Details:** A massive expansion pack for your favorite RPG drops this Friday. You need to schedule a marathon stream to cover it.\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Add this stream event to the end of your schedule.\r\n\r\n* **Title:** \"DLC Marathon\"\r\n* **Content:** \"Exploring the new expansion map all night!\"\r\n* **Image:** \"dlc.jpg\"",
